<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy"><section class="section"><div class="container richtext"><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p><strong>Replace this starter policy before collecting personal information.</strong></p><p>This static starter site does not include cookies, advertising trackers, newsletter forms, or a database by default. Vercel and other infrastructure providers may process limited technical information necessary to deliver and secure the website.</p><p>When you add analytics, forms, advertising, embedded media, or email marketing, update this policy to identify the services used, information collected, purposes, retention practices, and user choices.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
